ouple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,84,42,33,60,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,84,42,33,60,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,84,42,33,60,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,84,42,33,60,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1024","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,84,42,33,60,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10011","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,84,42,33,60,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"武圣侍从，力大无穷，熟谙水性，忠烈勇猛。曾为黄巾军势力下一名勇将，黄巾之乱被平息后与党羽裴元绍一同在卧牛山称贼，后者欲夺赵云之马而被杀，周仓则与赵云交手数次，身中三枪。在关羽过五关斩六将路途遇关羽的护送夫人部队，因久闻关羽盛名而主动请求加入关羽麾下，后经常出现关羽左右，随关羽南征北战，对关羽忠心不二，矢志不移，多次在战斗中担任护卫。在水淹七军一战中靠蛮力生擒庞德。关羽败走麦城后，周仓和王甫留守麦城，听闻关羽父子死讯，自刎而亡。被世人称为“天下第一忠心之人”。","tc":"武圣侍從，力大無窮，熟諳水性，忠烈勇猛。曾為黃巾軍勢力下一名勇將，黃巾之亂被平息后與黨羽裴元紹一同在臥牛山稱賊，后者欲奪趙云之馬而被殺，周倉則與趙云交手數次，身中三槍。在關羽過五關斬六將路途遇關羽的護送夫人部隊，因久聞關羽盛名而主動請求加入關羽麾下，后經常出現關羽左右，隨關羽南征北戰，對關羽忠心不二，矢志不移，多次在戰斗中擔任護衛。在水淹七軍一戰中靠蠻力生擒龐德。關羽敗走麥城后，周倉和王甫留守麥城，聽聞關羽父子死訊，自刎而亡。被世人稱為“天下第一忠心之人”。","en":"Attendant of the God of War, a man of immense strength, skilled in the water, and fiercely loyal and brave. He was once a capable warrior under the Yellow Turban faction. After the Yellow Turban Rebellion was quelled, he and his comrade Pei Yuanshao became bandits at Mount Woniu, Pei tried to steal Zhao Yun's horse and was slain, while Zhou Cang fought Zhao Yun several times and took three spear wounds. When Guan Yu was escorting Liu Bei's wives through the five passes, Zhou Cang encountered him and, having long admired Guan Yu's fame, volunteered to serve him. He was thereafter always at Guan Yu's side, campaigning with him across north and south, utterly loyal and unwavering, frequently serving as his bodyguard in battle. During the flood of the Seven Armies, he captured Pang De alive with brute strength. After Guan Yu's defeat at Maicheng, Zhou Cang and Wang Fu stayed to hold the city. Upon hearing of Guan Yu and Guan Ping's deaths, Zhou Cang cut his own throat. He was hailed by the people as ‘the most loyal man under heaven.’","jp":"武聖の従者。怪力無双にして水練に長じ、忠烈勇猛。かつては黄巾軍勢力の勇将であったが、黄巾の乱が平定された後は仲間の裴元紹とともに臥牛山で山賊となった。裴元紹が趙雲の馬を奪おうとして討たれると、周倉は趙雲と幾度も交戦し、三度槍傷を負った。関羽が五関六将を突破する途上で夫人の護送部隊と巡り会い、かねてより関羽の名声を聞き及んでいたため自ら配下に加わることを願い出た。以後は常に関羽の左右に侍り、関羽に従って南征北戦し、二心なく忠節を尽くして幾度も戦場で護衛を務めた。水淹七軍の戦いでは、その怪力をもって龐徳を生け捕りにした。関羽が敗れて麦城に逃れた後は王甫とともに麦城の留守を守ったが、関羽父子の訃報を聞くと自刎して果てた。世人から「天下第一の忠臣」と称えられている。","kr":"무성의 시종으로, 엄청난 괴력을 지녔고 물에 능숙하며 충렬하고 용맹했다. 한때 황건적 세력 휘하의 용장이었으나 황건의 난이 평정된 후 무리인 배원소와 함께 와우산에서 산적이 되었다. 배원소가 조운의 말을 빼앗으려다 목숨을 잃자 주창은 조운과 수차례 맞붙었으나 세 차례나 창에 찔렸다. 관우가 오관을 돌파하여 여섯 장수를 베고 부인들을 호송하던 부대와 마주쳤을 때, 평소 관우의 높은 명성을 익히 들었던 터라 스스로 관우 휘하에 들기를 청했다. 이후 늘 관우의 곁을 지키며 남북으로 종군하였고, 변치 않는 충심으로 여러 전투에서 호위를 도맡았다. 칠군을 수몰시킨 전투에서는 괴력으로 방덕을 생포했다. 관우가 패하여 맥성으로 달아난 뒤에는 왕보와 함께 맥성을 지키다가 관우 부자의 부고를 듣고 자결했다. 세상 사람들로부터 '천하제일의 충신'이라 불린다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10018","remark":"","surname":"周","surnameTc":"周","surnameEn":"Zhou","surnameJp":"周","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"仓","nameTc":"倉","nameEn":"Cang","nameJp":"倉","nameKr":"창","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"周仓","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1024","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"84","wise":"42","politics":"33","charm":"60","will":"88","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"12","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"65/82/70/26/26/11/50/26","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1009802;1005100","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1003305","battleSoul":"1010805","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"7800","debateSoulPoint":"1700","strategy":"1003208","strategy2":"1008601","professions":"3/0/1/0/0/4/2/0/3/0/1/2/4/0/5/0/1/1/0/0/0/5/2/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"50","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"164","show":"184","death":"219","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"